WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.633 --> 00:00:03.370
[music playing]

00:00:10.543 --> 00:00:14.381
SAL: 90 kilos of cocaine were
found in the trunk of a vehicle

00:00:14.447 --> 00:00:17.517
at a Border Patrol checkpoint.

00:00:17.584 --> 00:00:21.554
The markings of the cocaine
packages were the scorpion.

00:00:21.621 --> 00:00:24.791
This was the label for
Amado and the Juarez Cartel.

00:00:24.858 --> 00:00:28.261
[music playing]

00:00:32.465 --> 00:00:34.968
If this guy was connected
to the Juarez Cartel,

00:00:35.034 --> 00:00:37.003
I knew this was
the break I needed.

00:00:37.070 --> 00:00:38.338
ACTOR AS SAL: Come with me.

00:00:44.377 --> 00:00:46.146
SAL: I said, "My name is Sal."

00:00:46.212 --> 00:00:47.280
I said, "What's your name?"

00:00:47.347 --> 00:00:50.417
He says, "I'm Rudy."

00:00:50.483 --> 00:00:53.086
I told him, I said, "Listen,
you're in a lot of trouble.

00:00:53.153 --> 00:00:54.788
The only way you're
going to get out of this

00:00:54.854 --> 00:00:59.359
is by telling me what you
know about this organization."

00:00:59.426 --> 00:01:01.327
He tells me, "I can't
cooperate with you.

00:01:01.394 --> 00:01:02.662
They're going to kill me."

00:01:02.729 --> 00:01:04.631
And I said, "They're
going to kill you anyways

00:01:04.697 --> 00:01:06.800
if I let you go,
because right here you

00:01:06.866 --> 00:01:09.869
lost a lot of their drugs."

00:01:09.936 --> 00:01:12.272
He says, "If I give you
information about the Cartel,

00:01:12.338 --> 00:01:14.374
can you go on and protect me?

00:01:14.441 --> 00:01:16.042
So I said, "Listen,
you want my help?

00:01:16.109 --> 00:01:17.510
You need to go on and
give me information

00:01:17.577 --> 00:01:19.179
that's going to be worthwhile."

00:01:21.481 --> 00:01:24.384
He knew that he was
in a no-win situation.

00:01:26.820 --> 00:01:29.389
He says, "The Cartel
is sending somebody

00:01:29.456 --> 00:01:31.491
from Juarez to make
sure that everything

00:01:31.558 --> 00:01:33.993
runs smooth on this load.

00:01:34.060 --> 00:01:35.462
They call him El Guapo.

00:01:35.528 --> 00:01:37.564
He's one of the shot
callers for the Cartel."

00:01:41.935 --> 00:01:45.271
Trying to penetrate any
criminal organization,

00:01:45.338 --> 00:01:49.342
the only way to do it is to
actually do undercover work.

00:01:49.409 --> 00:01:54.948
So I am thinking, wow, this is
going to be a great opportunity

00:01:55.014 --> 00:01:57.250
to get somebody
higher in the Cartel

00:01:57.317 --> 00:02:01.354
by role playing as
an Undercover Agent.

00:02:01.421 --> 00:02:05.091
I asked him, I said, "How
can I be a part of this?"

00:02:05.158 --> 00:02:06.459
He goes, "We need a driver."

00:02:10.096 --> 00:02:13.366
Now I was going to be a
driver for the Cartel.

00:02:13.433 --> 00:02:14.834
ACTOR AS SAL: Let's move out.

00:02:14.901 --> 00:02:16.102
SAL: But.

00:02:16.169 --> 00:02:18.805
I had no idea what I
had just signed up for.

00:02:18.872 --> 00:02:21.708
[music playing]

00:02:24.410 --> 00:02:27.146
SAL: The next day, I drive to
a warehouse in the outskirts

00:02:27.213 --> 00:02:29.048
of El Paso as an
Undercover Agent

00:02:29.115 --> 00:02:31.117
with the 90 kilos
of cocaine that

00:02:31.184 --> 00:02:33.286
were seized the day before.

00:02:33.353 --> 00:02:35.388
El Guapo was going
to inspect it.

00:02:39.592 --> 00:02:45.198
I had backup, numerous DEA
Agents all over the place.

00:02:45.265 --> 00:02:47.500
At the same time, I was
very nervous and unsure

00:02:47.567 --> 00:02:48.801
of what was going to happen.

00:02:48.868 --> 00:02:52.372
[music playing]

00:02:57.076 --> 00:02:59.379
[gun clicking]

00:02:59.445 --> 00:03:01.614
We're waiting on
El Guapo to show up.

00:03:01.681 --> 00:03:03.750
I can see that Rudy
is definitely nervous.

00:03:06.519 --> 00:03:10.623
[door closes]

00:03:10.690 --> 00:03:13.192
The door opens and
here comes El Guapo.

00:03:16.429 --> 00:03:18.765
I could just feel the
energy with this guy

00:03:18.831 --> 00:03:22.535
and it was not a good thing.

00:03:22.602 --> 00:03:27.273
He's a Cartel manager
in a position of power.

00:03:27.340 --> 00:03:30.009
I was intimidated, the
same time, I had to go on

00:03:30.076 --> 00:03:32.946
and do what I was
supposed to do.

00:03:33.012 --> 00:03:34.147
ACTOR AS SAL: I'm Sal.

00:03:34.213 --> 00:03:35.315
I'll be driving.

00:03:37.850 --> 00:03:42.288
SAL: He just looked at me and
he goes, "How do you know Rudy?"

00:03:42.355 --> 00:03:45.625
And I said, "Well, me
and Rudy go back a ways."

00:03:45.692 --> 00:03:47.860
He had no idea Rudy
had betrayed him.

00:03:51.531 --> 00:03:54.601
He's staring me up and down.

00:03:54.667 --> 00:03:57.570
He notices the gun
under my belt. He says,

00:03:57.637 --> 00:03:59.906
"That's a pretty good
sized gun you got there."

00:03:59.973 --> 00:04:00.840
I said, "Yeah."

00:04:00.907 --> 00:04:01.674
And he goes, "Let me see it."

00:04:01.741 --> 00:04:04.410
[suspenseful music]

00:04:09.182 --> 00:04:12.585
And he starts looking
at it, inspecting it.

00:04:12.652 --> 00:04:14.721
I was getting nervous.

00:04:14.787 --> 00:04:16.022
[gun clicking]

00:04:16.089 --> 00:04:18.224
But all of a sudden, he
puts the gun to my head

00:04:18.291 --> 00:04:19.492
and he asked me--

00:04:19.559 --> 00:04:21.461
MAN: "So tell me again
how you know Rudy?"

00:04:25.231 --> 00:04:27.033
SAL: I thought to
myself, holy, he's

00:04:27.100 --> 00:04:28.401
going to blow my brains out.

00:04:31.804 --> 00:04:32.705
So I just said--

00:04:32.772 --> 00:04:34.307
ACTOR AS SAL: "Hey, listen.

00:04:34.374 --> 00:04:35.708
Stop busting my balls."

00:04:38.745 --> 00:04:41.714
SAL: He cracked a smile,
and lowered the gun,

00:04:41.781 --> 00:04:43.750
and handed it back to me.

00:04:43.816 --> 00:04:45.018
Inside I was furious.

00:04:45.084 --> 00:04:47.720
I wanted to get that
gun and shove it up his.

00:04:47.787 --> 00:04:49.822
MAN: Unload the coke.

00:04:49.889 --> 00:04:52.825
SAL: But I had to keep
my cool and continue

00:04:52.892 --> 00:04:55.395
with what we were going to do.

00:04:55.461 --> 00:04:58.097
We unload the cocaine
and the whole time,

00:04:58.164 --> 00:05:01.300
El Guapo was just standing
there watching us.

00:05:01.367 --> 00:05:06.105
My heart was racing
and I'm thinking,

00:05:06.172 --> 00:05:09.442
OK, maybe I hit the
mother load here.

00:05:09.509 --> 00:05:11.444
This was enough to arrest him.

00:05:15.348 --> 00:05:17.984
Eventually, he ended up saying,
"Go on and get out of here."

00:05:18.051 --> 00:05:19.752
MAN: This thing will
be moving tomorrow.

00:05:22.255 --> 00:05:24.257
SAL: This is the
opportunity that I wanted.

00:05:24.323 --> 00:05:26.059
OK, I just pull out my gun.

00:05:26.125 --> 00:05:27.326
[gun clicking]

00:05:27.393 --> 00:05:28.628
ACTOR AS SAL: DEA!

00:05:28.695 --> 00:05:30.263
SAL: "Put your hands up
where I can see them."

00:05:30.329 --> 00:05:31.230
[guns clicking]

00:05:31.297 --> 00:05:35.868
[speaking spanish]

00:05:35.935 --> 00:05:37.103
SAL: He was furious.

00:05:40.373 --> 00:05:41.708
He wanted to kick
my ass right there

00:05:41.774 --> 00:05:43.776
but I knew I had the
upper hand this time.

00:05:43.843 --> 00:05:47.814
[music playing]

